            <div xml:id="d974">

                <pb facs="0831" n="823" xml:id="pg823"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.52/54: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-03-06T12:00:00+09:00">March 6,
                        1937—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received March 6—12:52 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>80. Department’s 40, March 5, 11 a.m. Perpetual leaseholds. Draft documents
                    submitted to Foreign Office this morning. Foreign Office perceives no objection
                    to immediate publicity release in Washington.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
